  "summary": "Senior Software Engineer with 9+ years of experience building scalable web applications, cloud-based platforms, and AI-powered products. Experienced in developing GenAI and LLM-based solutions using RAG, prompt engineering, vector search, and AI-assisted workflows to deliver more intelligent and personalized user experiences. Strong background in designing customer-facing applications, backend services, APIs, distributed systems, and cloud-native architectures. Proven experience delivering products across business formation, travel, and collectibles platforms while improving performance, reliability, and usability. Skilled at leading technical initiatives, mentoring engineers, reviewing code, and collaborating with product, design, QA, and data teams. Passionate about combining AI technologies with modern software engineering to solve complex business problems and build scalable digital products.",
