    "description": "Built and enhanced web and AI-powered products that help entrepreneurs start, manage, and grow their businesses. Contributed to business formation, compliance, customer workflows, and LLM-based features while working across product, design, QA, and data teams.\n\n▪ Built and maintained customer-facing applications for business formation, compliance, and account management using React, TypeScript, Redux, and Material UI.\n▪ Developed AI-powered features using LLM APIs, Python, and prompt engineering to provide personalized guidance for entrepreneurs starting and managing businesses.\n▪ Built RAG-based workflows and vector search to ground LLM responses with business formation, compliance, and internal knowledge data.\n▪ Improved LLM responses through prompt optimization, context management, response validation, and evaluation testing to increase accuracy and reduce hallucinations.\n▪ Developed backend services using Node.js, Express, GraphQL, and REST APIs for business filings, customer accounts, documents, and compliance services.\n▪ Built workflows for LLC and corporation formation, including state filings, EIN services, document management, and registered agent services.\n▪ Used PostgreSQL to manage customer, subscription, filing, compliance, and business data, and optimized queries for better application performance.\n▪ Integrated third-party services for payments, business verification, state filings, notifications, and customer support workflows.\n▪ Deployed and maintained scalable applications using Google Cloud Platform, Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines.\n▪ Used Jest, React Testing Library, and Cypress, performed code reviews, mentored engineers, and worked closely with product, UX, QA, and data teams.",
